\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces This figure presents the distribution of proper motion for the cluster, depicted by an ellipse. The ellipse represents the mean proper motion $\boldsymbol  {\overline  {\mu }}$ and the covariance matrix ($\boldsymbol  {\Sigma }$), reflecting the center and shape of the proper motion distribution, respectively. The color of each point in the scatter plot corresponds to the assigned probability of the source. The gray error bars indicate the measurement uncertainties in the proper motion coordinates. The $x$-axis represents the corrected proper motion in the $\alpha ^*$ direction ($\mu _{\alpha *}$), while the $y$-axis represents the corrected proper motion in the $\delta $ direction ($\mu _\delta $). The green star marker and error bars represent the proper motion coordinates and their uncertainties for the source HD 159176. The ellipse encapsulates the estimated $95\%$ region of the proper motion distribution.}}{5}{figure.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:pm}{{4}{5}{This figure presents the distribution of proper motion for the cluster, depicted by an ellipse. The ellipse represents the mean proper motion $\boldsymbol {\overline {\mu }}$ and the covariance matrix ($\boldsymbol {\Sigma }$), reflecting the center and shape of the proper motion distribution, respectively. The color of each point in the scatter plot corresponds to the assigned probability of the source. The gray error bars indicate the measurement uncertainties in the proper motion coordinates. The $x$-axis represents the corrected proper motion in the $\alpha ^*$ direction ($\mu _{\alpha *}$), while the $y$-axis represents the corrected proper motion in the $\delta $ direction ($\mu _\delta $). The green star marker and error bars represent the proper motion coordinates and their uncertainties for the source HD 159176. The ellipse encapsulates the estimated $95\%$ region of the proper motion distribution}{figure.4}{}}
