\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces This comprehensive graphic showcases three different CMD of NGC 6383. In the left, the CMD of the cluster, that captures the essence of the cluster's stellar population and the best-fitting isochrone gracefully aligns with the CMD. Meanwhile, on the center side, a captivating Hess diagram depicts the comparison between observed and synthetic data, highlighting any variations and emphasizing the accuracy of the isochrone model. Finally, on the right section, the synthetic cluster takes shape, carefully integrated with the isochrone.}}{8}{figure.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:cmd}{{6}{8}{This comprehensive graphic showcases three different CMD of NGC 6383. In the left, the CMD of the cluster, that captures the essence of the cluster's stellar population and the best-fitting isochrone gracefully aligns with the CMD. Meanwhile, on the center side, a captivating Hess diagram depicts the comparison between observed and synthetic data, highlighting any variations and emphasizing the accuracy of the isochrone model. Finally, on the right section, the synthetic cluster takes shape, carefully integrated with the isochrone}{figure.6}{}}
