\newlabel{tab:results_probs}{{3}{11}{Detailed parameters of the open cluster NGC 6383 at different probability levels. The table includes structural parameters such as tidal, cluster, and core radii, and star densities, among others. Each parameter is reported at 60\%, 70\%, 80\%, and 90\% probabilities, along with their respective standard deviations}{table.3}{}}
